	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>Blackguards, unlike most paladins, cultivate notoriety rather than heroic fame. By striking fear into the hearts of their opponents, a blackguard often wins a psychological battle with their opponent before even drawing weapons. A blackguard's magic focuses on debilitating opponents and preventing them from recovering from wounds.</em></p><table><caption><p>The Blackguard</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Features</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.9K1Vge7T7DvnjSFH]{Howl of Terror} or @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.CVLKmno4HKVNPSju]{Lull of Death}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.O2tjfTTI7LK99HnZ]{Aura of Corruption}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.9K1Vge7T7DvnjSFH]{Howl of Terror} or @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.CVLKmno4HKVNPSju]{Lull of Death}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.xP5g1W3lOOnlHwBo]{Strickening Gaze}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><caption><p>Expanded Spell List</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Paladin Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Extra Spells</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.43Vyt2wzU0SISfYm]{Rend Vigor}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.cHIuORdoA1WnHfmK]{Well of Corruption}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.GBsOYscOZmOZy0Ff]{Fear}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>13</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.Y7ncQQZXoZGGqJun]{Phantasmal Killer}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>17</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.JMvciQxc508dJ3t8]{